  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience true vintage style with Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Vietnam Ripstop Fatigue Pants. Crafted from soft, lightweight cotton and inspired by the original Vietnam era uniform, these pants offer an iconic, timeless look that transcends generations. With six pockets, including two front slash pockets, two button-down bellow cargo pockets, and two button-down back pockets, you get all the storage you need for everyday carry (EDC) essentials. The adjustable waist tabs ensure a perfect fit no matter your body type. Whether you&rsquo;re looking to get outdoor ready, geared up for work or just want a great everyday pant, Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Fatigue Pants are the right choice for you.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
